      "title": "Mentions légales",
      "slug": "mentions-legales",
      "body": "<!-- Leaflet CSS (pour la carte interactive) -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css\">\n\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* En-tête de section */\n    .section-title {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #dcdcdc; /* Gris clair */\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    /* Conteneur principal */\n    .contact-container {\n      max-width: 1100px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 30px;\n      padding: 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    /* Section Infos (gauche) */\n    .contact-info {\n      flex: 1;\n      min-width: 320px;\n    }\n\n    .contact-info h1 {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #222;\n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .address-group {\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .parking-info {\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n    }\n\n    .contact-list {\n      list-style: none;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #444;\n    }\n\n    .contact-list li {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .contact-list strong {\n      color: #222;\n    }\n\n    .social-links {\n      margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .social-links a {\n      color: #ccc;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .social-links a:hover {\n      text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n\n    /* Section Carte (droite) */\n    .map-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      min-width: 320px;\n      height: 380px;\n      border: 1px solid #ccc;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    }\n\n    #map {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n\n    /* Adaptabilité mobile */\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .contact-container {\n        flex-direction: column;\n      }\n      .contact-info h1 {\n        text-align: center;\n      }\n      .map-container {\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n\n  <h2 class=\"section-title\">NOUS CONTACTER</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"contact-container\">\n    <!-- Informations à gauche -->\n    <div class=\"contact-info\">\n      <h1>AS THIAIS TENNIS DE TABLE</h1>\n      \n      <div class=\"address-group\">\n        PALAIS OMNISPORTS DE THIAIS - PLACE VINCENT VAN GOGH<br>\n        94320 THIAIS\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"parking-info\">\n        Parking de plus de 100 places.\n      </div>\n\n      <ul class=\"contact-list\">\n        <li><strong>Président:</strong> Pierre Mathieu GERMAIN germain.pierremathieu@gmail.com 06 66 48 25 24</li>\n        <li><strong>Vice Président:</strong> Philippe LEWI philippe.lewi@sfr.fr 06 81 61 21 24</li>\n        <li><strong>Trésorier:</strong> Emmanuel MONTREUIL montreuil.emmanuel[at]orange.fr 06 83 96 40 67</li>\n        <li><strong>Secrétaire:</strong> Fabrice COUTURAS fabcou[at]neuf.fr 06 82 01 05 69</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"contact-list social-links\">\n        <p><strong>Facebook :</strong> <a href=\"#\">thiais.ping.5</a></p>\n        <p><strong>Instagram :</strong> <a href=\"#\">thiais_ping</a></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Carte Leaflet / OpenStreetMap à droite -->\n    <div class=\"map-container\">\n      <div id=\"map\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Leaflet JS -->\n  <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js\"></script>\n  <script>\n    // Coordonnées du Palais des Sports de Thiais (Place Vincent Van Gogh)\n    const lat = 48.7618;\n    const lng = 2.3920;\n\n    // Initialisation de la carte\n    const map = L.map('map').setView([lat, lng], 15);\n\n    // Ajout de la couche de tuiles OpenStreetMap\n    L.tileLayer('https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png', {\n      maxZoom: 19,\n      attribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors'\n    }).addTo(map);\n\n    // Ajout du marquer bleu\n    L.marker([lat, lng]).addTo(map);\n  </script>",
      "date": "2026-08-14"
    }
  ]
